---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Echoes" description="Echoes is the student's panorama of Thapar Institute of Engineering & Technology.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="About" title="The student's panorama of TIET" />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-14">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center">
      <img src="/images/brand/group-picture.jpg" alt="The Echoes team" class="border border-black/10 object-cover" />
      <div class="prose-body text-lg">
        <p>
          Echoes ensures to cross the threshold beyond what our eyes can perceive. There are stories hidden in
          crevices of the world and often in the palm of our hands. We are a group of young and diverse-minded
          individuals who hope to amplify everything through media. Along with engaging content, we strive to
          present fresh and authentic news from across the college. However, we do not stop there and take steps to
          enlighten our audience with the world's occurrences as well.
        </p>
        <p>We envision touching multiple dimensions of journalism, broadcasting, and media coverage, and we aim to do a lot more than just that.</p>
        <p>
          Being The Student's Panorama of TIET, we strive towards giving the students a holistic experience that
          encompasses the cultural, technical, sports, and academic aspects of this college. We aim to reflect the
          spectrum of achievements and activities of our college societies and students, and give updates regarding
          the college ongoings and upcomings.
        </p>
        <p>But to put it all simply, Echoes is a club of the students, by the students, and for the students.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
